  - key: weather.hailing
    hint: precipitation falling as balls of ice (hail) during a storm
    image: weather.hailing.png
    brief:
      subject: hailstorm
      attrs: [ice balls falling from dark clouds, bouncing on ground, dents in car or leaves]
      setting: [outdoor, dark storm clouds, dramatic]
      avoid: [text, snow, rain, humans]

  - key: weather.thunderstorm
    hint: a storm with heavy rain, lightning and thunder
    image: weather.thunderstorm.png
    brief:
      subject: thunderstorm
      attrs: [dark dramatic clouds, heavy rain, lightning bolt, dark sky, flooded street]
      setting: [outdoor, night or dark day, dramatic atmosphere]
      avoid: [text, sunshine, humans, fire]

  - key: weather.lightning
    hint: a bright electric discharge from clouds during a storm (fulmen)
    image: weather.lightning.png
    brief:
      subject: lightning bolt
      attrs: [vivid white-yellow lightning bolt, jagged, dramatic sky, dark clouds]
      setting: [outdoor, night, dark dramatic sky]
      avoid: [text, humans, fire, buildings struck]

  - key: weather.frosty
    hint: covered in frost, ice crystals on surfaces when temperature drops below freezing
    image: weather.frosty.png
    brief:
      subject: frosty morning
      attrs: [white frost crystals on leaves and grass, cold sparkle, delicate ice patterns]
      setting: [outdoor, winter morning, close-up on frost]
      avoid: [text, snow falling, rain, people]

  - key: weather.icy
    hint: surfaces covered in ice, slippery roads and frozen water (glacies)
