    brief:
      subject: icy road or frozen lake
      attrs: [shiny slick ice surface, frozen reflection, white or blue ice, frost]
      setting: [outdoor, winter, low sun on ice, cold atmosphere]
      avoid: [text, snow, humans slipping, danger]

  - key: weather.humid
    hint: air that contains a lot of water vapour, sticky and heavy feeling
